Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:35:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vmess: allow UpdateUsers while the service is running

UpdateUsers may now be called while the service runs. The users sit
behind a read-write lock, held only for the lookup of each client, so an
update never waits on a client.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: packet-boats[bot] <346322443+packet-boats[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
